                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>To provide for the continuation of the cooperative reconnaissance surveys for a
                    proposed inter-American Highway as provided in Public Resolution No. 104,
                    approved March 4, 1929 (45 Stat. 1697) and for making location surveys, plans
                    and estimates for such highway, the Secretary of Agriculture is hereby
                    authorized to pay all costs hereafter incurred for such work from any moneys
                    available from the administrative funds provided under the Act of July 11, 1916
                    (U. S. C. title 23, sec. 21) as amended, or as otherwise provided.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
